  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mobilitetsst&#xf6;d - FORMAS 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobility starting grant - FORMAS 2013-2016 - FORMAS 2013 - 2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att &#xf6;ka andelen svensk forskning som bidrar till att identifiera faktorer som bidrar till, samt bidra till att hitta   l&#xf6;sningar till problem, som drabbar fr&#xe4;mst m&#xe4;nniskor och milj&#xf6; i      l&#xe5;ginkomstl&#xe4;nder. Detta skall uppn&#xe5;s genom en samutlysning med        Forskningsr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;, areella n&#xe4;ringar och samh&#xe4;llsbyggande      (FORMAS)om mobilitetst&#xf6;d inom omr&#xe5;det forskning om h&#xe5;llbar utveckling</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The effort aims to increase the proportion of Swedish research that contributes to identifying factors that contribute to, as well as contribute to finding solutions to, problems that primarily affect people and the environment in low-income countries. This is to be achieved through a joint announcement with the Research Council for the Environment, Land Industries and Community Building (FORMAS) on mobility support in the area of ??research on sustainable development</narrative>
  </description>
